==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Torracat|28}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Torracat}}.
*'''Heat Tackle''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Blaine's Arcanine|1}} from {{TCG|Gym Challenge}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

